      "id": "resize-is-metrics-not-a-dispatch",
      "why": "A surface resize crosses the same wire but is NOT a DispatchEvent: the Worker hands it to handle_metrics. It is the ONE event that carries physical pixels — the GPU surface extent — beside the dpr the renderer divides by to get the logical extent layout uses.",
